# PM workspace environment (variable NAMES only; never put values in a committed file). Copy to claude.env if needed.
# AISDLC_ROOT is resolved from the current folder automatically; set it only to run from elsewhere.
#
# Jira credentials are read from the environment ONLY (never from this workspace). Set them in your own shell/profile,
# not in claude.env, and never commit them:
#   JIRA_EMAIL        your Jira account email (Jira Cloud basic auth)
#   JIRA_API_TOKEN    your Jira API token / personal access token
#
# The variable NAMES above are the defaults; config/integrations.yaml under jira.credentials can rename them. This
# file documents the names only and holds no values.
